SOLUTION

RULES AND ACTIONS
Container Accessing Host Filesystem: access to host files 
                                      ISOLATION
Container Escape: Writes in files related to possible escapes 
                                      ISOLATION
Accessing Container Runtime Socket: Access to docker socket or containerd 
                                      ISOLATION
Escape Tool Executed: when nsenter is executed 
                                      ISOLATION
Mount Syscall: execution of mount calls 
                                      ALERT
Interactive Shell Spawned Interactive terminal opened 
                                        ALERT

OPTIONS OF FUNCTIONING 
DETECTION_MODE: simulation mode. just to detect and alert
ENFORCE: it includes isolation
